            {
              "Text": "Look 'round you, kid. This is a large-scale industrial operation, freight is coming and going constantly. Sadly, my staff is all full. We have no room for more grunts here.\\n\\nThough, I am hungry. Go grab me a Bronto Burger, and I must emphasize, a normal Bronto Burger. I may be able to think of something for you to do for me by the time you get back.",
