          ],
          "EnterActions": []
        },
        {
          "Id": "desmond_help",
          "PromptText": "Took you long enough. I was getting ready to call in one of my Bruisers to take care of this little chore, but I think you will be able to handle it.\\n\\nI hope you won't have any qualms with getting your hands dirty, as I have a mess that needs to be cleaned up.",
