          "PromptText": "You must be new around here! I offer a variety of food items, but I specialize in offering delicious Bronto Burger cuisine.\\n\\nIf you want a quick snack for the road, why not order up a Bronto Burger, or a Bronto Cheese, or my favorite: Double Bronto Cheese.\\n\\n<font color=\"#ff0000\">Press the button below marked with the symbol of a Shopping Cart.  It will give you an overview of the current stock",
